@startuml
' Figure 16.2  Constrained decoding and schema validation
' Reading order: top to bottom. The decoder can only emit tokens that
' fit the schema, so the shape arrives right. The gateway still runs the
' full schema, because the decoder skips bounds and a cut-off response
' is not covered.
!include plantuml-theme.puml
participant "Agent\nloop" as A <<model>>
participant "Model and\ndecoder" as M <<model>>
participant "Gateway\nintake" as G <<ops>>
A -> M : tools, strict schema
M -> M : sample only tokens\nthe schema allows
M --> A : tool call
note right of M : skipped: min,\nmax, lengths
A -> G : arguments
G -> G : full schema check
G -[$FAIL]-> A : cut off: fields missing
G --> A : passes, on to\nworld checks
@enduml
